  {
   "id": "we-were-here-too-54486@major-2025-10-09",
   "gameId": "we-were-here-too-54486",
   "displayName": "Cross-Play Update is Here: Connect with Explorers Everywhere!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-10-09T13:00:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Dear Explorers,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]It’s time to dust off those walkie-talkies because a brand new update has arrived!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]We’re thrilled to announce that cross-play is now available for We Were Here, We Were Here Too, and We Were Here Together!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]That means no matter if you’re playing on PC, PlayStation, Xbox, or Nintendo Switch, you and your partner can now connect and puzzle your way through Castle Rock together, across all platforms.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33592243/e7f94ee585321594e402fc550ed1e39d16285973.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]This has been one of our most requested features, and we’ve poured extra time and care into patching up the games so that your connection works seamlessly between devices. Whether you’re shouting directions from your desk or puzzling from the couch, your partner is now just one connection away.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Alongside this update, We Were Here Together has now joined the series on Nintendo Switch, opening the doors for a whole new wave of puzzlers to step into the cold. ❄️",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]So find your partner, start the call, and see how far your communication can take you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Because no matter the platform… The only way out is together.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Join us for an AMA over on Reddit!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "To celebrate this big milestone, we want to talk to you directly and answer any burning questions you may have for us.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Join us on the r/nintendo subreddit next Thursday October 16th at 3PM CEST / 6AM PDT / 8AM CDT, and you might even win some keys for our games on Switch!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33592243/9d31f5d5a04ff942797c94ed3d668c60cc4c0252.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Stay warm,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "— Total Mayhem Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
