  {
   "id": "we-were-here-too-54486@major-2020-06-05",
   "gameId": "we-were-here-too-54486",
   "displayName": "June News Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-06-05T18:28:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Good things are on the way...",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks to everyone who filled out the We Were Here series survey earlier this year! We've been poring over the results, and there's some fascinating stuff and great feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The results from the We Were Here survey have been very informative - there's a lot of solid feedback there. Feedback that we can take in for our next project. We're really looking forward to sharing stuff with you as soon as we can!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks again to everyone who took the time to fill it out! It really helps us define our path to next development chapter.. more on that in due course. Also a shout out to the brave 193 people (20% of respondents) who said that 'jump scares' are what they enjoy most in puzzles :D",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Check out this great fan art by player Fenris!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We Were Here Together now also on Xbox One!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We just released We Were Here Together for Xbox One, and we're already busy on more exciting things...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "That's all the news for now. Before signing off, we wanted to share this interestingly edited image by player Ensh'eass.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
