  {
   "id": "we-were-here-too-54486@patch-2018-02-09",
   "gameId": "we-were-here-too-54486",
   "displayName": "We Were Here Too - Patch V.09022018",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2018-02-09T21:49:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Let me start off with thanking you guys for hunting down and reporting some issues you may have encountered! Let's take a look at what today's patch has in store for our explorers.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch notes V.09022018 – February 9th 2018",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[The Stairwell]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with occlusion culling when standing in certain spots",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rebalanced the amount of time remaining on a wrong solution",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "[The Arena]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rebalanced the time available between some of the objectives",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "[The Elevator]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue with the rotating wheel when a controller was plugged in",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed alot of minor things that would make this list too big!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players can now select a region to connect with.: Please look for the dropdown menu in the top-right when searching or creating a new game and select the region with the best ping for you",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the spacing between the lobbies when searching for a game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Restarting from a checkpoint after a game over should now synchronize properly between players",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Resolved an issue with voice chat on the game over screen",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved voice chat: We managed to crack some bugs and issues, thanks for reporting them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved readability of the text on some of the books found around the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added some missing names to the credits: Sorry!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'll keep on improving our user experience with patches. Thanks again for all of your feedback and we hope you enjoy your time cooperating!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
